Package: methylQC
Title: QC and Preprocessing Pipeline for Illumina DNA Methylation Arrays
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R: person("Brian", "Chen", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "brianchen450k@gmail.com")
Description: Two-stage QC pipeline for Illumina Infinium DNA methylation
    arrays (EPIC, EPICv2, 450K). Stage 1 streams samples through SeSAMe
    openSesame, computes per-sample QC metrics (detection rate, intensity,
    Horvath epigenetic age, sex chromosome intensities), and extracts SNP
    probe betas. Stage 2 flags samples and probes, generates a multi-page
    QC report PDF, runs EpiDISH cell-type deconvolution for blood tissues,
    and outputs a consolidated sample sheet. Raw matrices are output with
    separate quality mask and detection p-value matrices. Users apply their
    own exclusion criteria via apply_mask(), which supports optional k-NN
    imputation.
